<title>USA: Centralia, Ill., won by EVEREN Securities.</title>
<headline>Centralia, Ill., won by EVEREN Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $1.675 million of Centralia, Ill., various general obligation bonds, with a  net interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
</text>
